     The ggeettrrlliimmiittuussaaggee system call allows the process to query current con‐
     sumption of the resources limited by the setrlimit(2) call.

     The _w_h_i_c_h argument specifies the resource, same as for getrlimit(2) and
     setrlimit(2) calls, see their man page for the list of enforced resource
     types.

